  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkning av Ukrainas kvalitetsinfrastruktur, 2023-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of Ukraine&#x2019;s Quality Infrastructure, 2023-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedac and SIS will support Ukraine to:

- Maintain the most important aspects of QI (Quality Infrastructure) during the war to sustain trade and vital public
services. As a result, it will increase export to the EU during the war.

- Strengthening the Ukrainian QI after the war to promote trade and support a green reconstruction. As a result, the short-term increase of export to EU and investment in export-oriented facilities. These investments will lead to increasing in export in the long term.

- Support the institutions within the QI in Ukraine in their adaptation to, and integration with, the EU. Integrated institutions will increase trust from local investors, as well as from foreign investors. It will lead to rising in long-term investment in export-oriented facilities.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ukraina &#xe4;r i en EU-n&#xe4;rmandeprocess. Kvalitetsinfrastruktur (KI) &#xe4;r en betydelsefull faktor f&#xf6;r den ekonomiska integreringen. Swedac och SIS kommer att st&#xf6;dja Ukraina med att uppr&#xe4;tth&#xe5;lla de viktigaste aspekterna av KI medan kriget p&#xe5;g&#xe5;r f&#xf6;r att uppr&#xe4;tth&#xe5;lla handel och viktiga offentliga tj&#xe4;nster; att st&#xe4;rka den ukrainska KI efter kriget f&#xf6;r att fr&#xe4;mja handel och st&#xf6;dja en gr&#xf6;n &#xe5;teruppbyggnad; att st&#xf6;dja institutionerna inom KI i Ukraina i deras anpassning till och integration med EU.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine is in the process of EU integration. Quality infrastructure (QI) is a significant factor in economic integration. Swedac and SIS will support Ukraine to maintain the most important aspects of QI while the war continues to sustain trade and vital public services; strengthening the Ukrainian QI after the war to promote trade and support a green reconstruction; support the institutions within the QI in Ukraine in their adaptation to, and integration with, the EU.</narrative>
  </description>
